<details><summary><span class="mno">M02</span><span class="mtitle">Networking and web plumbing</span><span class="mmeta">18 hrs · Wk 3-4</span> <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab"><ul><li>DNS, HTTP, TLS in practice</li><li>Load balancers and reverse proxies</li><li>Nginx configuration</li><li>Firewalls and ports</li><li>Lab: serve an app behind Nginx</li></ul></div></details>
