<details><summary><span class="mno">M05</span><span class="mtitle">Docker and containers</span><span class="mmeta">22 hrs · Wk 8-10</span> <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab"><ul><li>Images, layers, registries</li><li>Dockerfiles that do not embarrass you</li><li>Compose for multi-service apps</li><li>Container networking and volumes</li><li>Lab: containerise a real application</li></ul></div></details>
<details><summary><span class="mno">M06</span><span class="mtitle">Kubernetes</span><span class="mmeta">28 hrs · Wk 10-12</span> <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab"><ul><li>Pods, deployments, services</li><li>ConfigMaps, secrets, probes</li><li>Ingress and scaling</li><li>Helm basics</li><li>Lab: run your app on a K8s cluster</li></ul></div></details>
<details><summary><span class="mno">M07</span><span class="mtitle">Infrastructure as Code: Terraform</span><span class="mmeta">22 hrs · Wk 12-14</span> <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab"><ul><li>HCL and the plan/apply loop</li><li>Modules and state discipline</li><li>Provisioning AWS end to end</li><li>Drift and refactoring</li><li>Project: your whole stack from code</li></ul></div></details>
