<section class="sec" id="faq" style="background:#fff">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow reveal">FAQ</span>
<h2 class="st reveal">The questions people actually <span class="serif">ask.</span></h2>
<p class="lede reveal">If yours isn't here, a counsellor answers it on a 20-minute call.</p>
<div class="faq-wrap">
<div class="acc reveal">
<details open=""><summary>Do I need to be a developer to learn DevOps? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">No. DevOps grew out of operations. Linux comfort and systematic thinking matter most; we teach the scripting you need. Developers gain deployment superpowers; sysadmins convert directly.</div></details>
<details><summary>Which cloud do you teach, and why AWS? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">AWS, because it holds the largest share of Indian job postings and its concepts transfer to Azure and GCP. The Terraform module makes you portable across clouds by design.</div></details>
<details><summary>Which certifications does the course prepare me for? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">AWS Solutions Architect Associate (SAA-C03) with full mock exams, plus the Terraform Associate pathway. Exams are booked with AWS and HashiCorp and charged separately.</div></details>
<details><summary>What is the starting salary in cloud and DevOps? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Junior cloud engineers typically start between Rs 4 and 7 lakh. With two to three years and Kubernetes ownership, Rs 7 to 14 lakh is common, and platform seniors go far beyond.</div></details>
<details><summary>Is Kubernetes really necessary for a first job? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Increasingly yes for the better roles. Many juniors get hired on AWS + Docker + CI/CD, but K8s fluency is what separates ticket-takers from platform engineers, so we teach it properly.</div></details>
<details><summary>Will I practise on real cloud infrastructure? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Yes. You work in real AWS accounts within guarded budgets, break and rebuild environments, and finish with Terraform-provisioned architecture and a pipeline that deploys on push.</div></details>
<details><summary>Is it online or classroom, and is Malayalam support available? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">Both. In-person batches in Trivandrum, Kochi and Bengaluru, plus live online batches across Kerala and the GCC. Sessions are in clear English with Malayalam support.</div></details>
<details><summary>Do you guarantee a job after the course? <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab">No, and we will not pretend otherwise. We provide structured placement support and real introductions across 400+ partners, with support continuing six months after you finish.</div></details>
</div>
